.DS_Store

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

pytorch.venvsource/

# Training and testing outputs, written into each datasets/<name>/
model_weights/
y_pred_true*
runs/
# but keep the test predictions archived with each round of experiments
!experiments/**/y_pred_true*

# GNN graphs (tools/build_graphs.py): large, and rebuilt from the datasets
graphs*.pkl

# MAPFAST-GNN sweeps (models/train_gnn.py): keep select's rankings and figures (summary*.md, sweep*.png) and each
# configuration's results.json; leave out the weights, the per-fold outputs, the configurations' test picks (the
# selected ones are archived in each round's predictions/) and the Slurm logs
experiments/**/gnn_sweep/**/model.pt
experiments/**/gnn_sweep/**/fold*of*.npz
experiments/**/gnn_sweep/**/predictions.json
experiments/**/gnn_sweep/**/*.out
experiments/**/gnn_sweep/**/*.err


experiments/*/logs/
typesafe_key.txt

CLAUDE.md